{"seq":2,"slug":"bayesian-analysis-r","title":"贝叶斯分析与 Stan/brms","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/bayesian-analysis-r","wordCount":1164,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯分析与-stan-brms\">贝叶斯分析与 Stan/brms</h1><p>贝叶斯统计将参数视为随机变量，通过贝叶斯定理将先验信念与观测数据结合得到后验分布。R 生态中，Stan 是工业级概率编程语言，通过 NUTS（No-U-Turn Sampler）自适应哈密顿蒙特卡洛实现高维后验采样；brms 则用 R 公式语法自动生成 Stan 代码，让统计学家无需手写概率模型即可拟合从线性回归到多层广义模型的几乎任何结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>贝叶斯推断把参数视为随机变量</strong>，通过贝叶斯定理把先验信念与观测数据合成后验分布。</li>\n<li><strong>后验 ∝ 似然 × 先验</strong>：归一化常数通常无需计算，这正是 MCMC 采样可行的原因。</li>\n<li><strong>Stan 是概率编程语言，NUTS 是其采样引擎</strong>：手工写模型换来最大灵活性。</li>\n<li><strong>brms 用 R 公式语法自动生成 Stan 代码</strong>，把贝叶斯的门槛降到与 <code>lm()</code> 相当。</li>\n<li><strong>先验选择是建模决策而非形式</strong>：弱信息先验是推荐默认，信息先验需要文献或专家依据。</li>\n<li><strong>收敛诊断有量化判据</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{R} &lt; 1.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9859em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.01</span></span></span></span></span>、ESS &gt; 400、发散次数为 0。</li>\n<li><strong>模型比较用 LOO-CV 而非 F 检验</strong>，因为贝叶斯模型通常不嵌套。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯框架基础\">贝叶斯框架基础</h2><p>贝叶斯定理的核心表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>∝</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta | \\mathbf{y}) = \\frac{p(\\mathbf{y} | \\theta) \\cdot p(\\theta)}{p(\\mathbf{y})} \\propto p(\\mathbf{y} | \\theta) \\cdot p(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>R 中的对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>后验</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta | \\mathbf{y})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>观测数据后的参数信念</td>\n<td>MCMC 样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>似然</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\mathbf{y} | \\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数据生成过程</td>\n<td><code>family</code> 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先验</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>观测前的参数信念</td>\n<td><code>prior</code> 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\mathbf{y})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>边际似然（归一化常数）</td>\n<td>通常不直接计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么选择贝叶斯\">为什么选择贝叶斯</h3><p>频率派方法给出点估计 + 置信区间；贝叶斯方法给出完整的后验分布。关键优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不确定性量化</strong>：后验分布直接回答&quot;参数落在某区间的概率是多少&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>小样本稳健性</strong>：先验正则化防止过拟合</li>\n<li><strong>自然的层级结构</strong>：多层模型中参数间借力（partial pooling）</li>\n<li><strong>灵活的模型比较</strong>：LOO-CV、WAIC 替代嵌套模型的 F 检验</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"stan-概率编程\">Stan 概率编程</h2><p>Stan 使用自己的领域特定语言描述概率模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"stan\" data-code=\"// 线性回归的 Stan 模型&#10;data {&#10;  int&lt;lower=0&gt; N;&#10;  vector[N] x;&#10;  vector[N] y;&#10;}&#10;parameters {&#10;  real alpha;&#10;  real beta;&#10;  real&lt;lower=0&gt; sigma;&#10;}&#10;model {&#10;  // 先验&#10;  alpha ~ normal(0, 10);&#10;  beta ~ normal(0, 5);&#10;  sigma ~ exponential(1);&#10;  // 似然&#10;  y ~ normal(alpha + beta * x, sigma);&#10;}&#10;generated quantities {&#10;  vector[N] y_rep;&#10;  for (n in 1:N)&#10;    y_rep[n] = normal_rng(alpha + beta * x[n], sigma);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 线性回归的 Stan 模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int&#x3C;lower=0> N;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  vector[N] x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  vector[N] y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parameters {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  real alpha;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  real beta;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  real&#x3C;lower=0> sigma;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 先验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  alpha ~ normal(0, 10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  beta ~ normal(0, 5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sigma ~ exponential(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 似然</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y ~ normal(alpha + beta * x, sigma);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>generated quantities {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  vector[N] y_rep;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (n in 1:N)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y_rep[n] = normal_rng(alpha + beta * x[n], sigma);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cmdstanr-接口\">cmdstanr 接口</h3><p>cmdstanr 是 Stan 的推荐 R 接口（取代较老的 rstan），基于 CmdStan 命令行工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(cmdstanr)&#10;&#10;model &lt;- cmdstan_model(&quot;linear_regression.stan&quot;)&#10;fit &lt;- model$sample(&#10;  data = list(N = nrow(df), x = df$x, y = df$y),&#10;  chains = 4,&#10;  parallel_chains = 4,&#10;  iter_warmup = 1000,&#10;  iter_sampling = 2000&#10;)&#10;&#10;fit$summary()&#10;fit$draws(&quot;beta&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(cmdstanr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model &#x3C;- cmdstan_model(\"linear_regression.stan\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fit &#x3C;- model$sample(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = list(N = nrow(df), x = df$x, y = df$y),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  chains = 4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  parallel_chains = 4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  iter_warmup = 1000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  iter_sampling = 2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fit$summary()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fit$draws(\"beta\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"brms-公式语法的贝叶斯建模\">brms：公式语法的贝叶斯建模</h2><p>brms（Bayesian Regression Models using Stan）让你用 R 公式语法定义复杂贝叶斯模型，自动翻译为 Stan 代码并编译运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(brms)&#10;&#10;# 简单线性回归的贝叶斯版本&#10;fit_bayes &lt;- brm(&#10;  body_mass_g ~ bill_length_mm + flipper_length_mm + species,&#10;  data = penguins,&#10;  family = gaussian(),&#10;  prior = c(&#10;    prior(normal(0, 1000), class = &quot;Intercept&quot;),&#10;    prior(normal(0, 100), class = &quot;b&quot;),&#10;    prior(exponential(0.01), class = &quot;sigma&quot;)&#10;  ),&#10;  chains = 4,&#10;  cores = 4,&#10;  iter = 4000,&#10;  warmup = 1000&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(brms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 简单线性回归的贝叶斯版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fit_bayes &#x3C;- brm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body_mass_g ~ bill_length_mm + flipper_length_mm + species,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = penguins,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  family = gaussian(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prior = c(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(normal(0, 1000), class = \"Intercept\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(normal(0, 100), class = \"b\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(exponential(0.01), class = \"sigma\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  chains = 4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cores = 4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  iter = 4000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  warmup = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"brms-公式扩展\">brms 公式扩展</h3><p>brms 超越了标准 R 公式，支持分布参数建模、非线性模型、测量误差：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 多层模型（随机效应）&#10;brm(score ~ treatment + (1 + treatment | school), data = df)&#10;&#10;# 零膨胀 Poisson&#10;brm(count ~ x1 + x2, data = df, family = zero_inflated_poisson())&#10;&#10;# 序数回归&#10;brm(rating ~ predictor, data = df, family = cumulative(&quot;logit&quot;))&#10;&#10;# 分布参数建模（sigma 也依赖协变量）&#10;brm(bf(y ~ x, sigma ~ group), data = df)&#10;&#10;# 非线性模型&#10;brm(bf(y ~ a * exp(-b * x), a ~ 1, b ~ 1, nl = TRUE), data = df)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 多层模型（随机效应）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brm(score ~ treatment + (1 + treatment | school), data = df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 零膨胀 Poisson</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brm(count ~ x1 + x2, data = df, family = zero_inflated_poisson())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 序数回归</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brm(rating ~ predictor, data = df, family = cumulative(\"logit\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 分布参数建模（sigma 也依赖协变量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brm(bf(y ~ x, sigma ~ group), data = df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 非线性模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brm(bf(y ~ a * exp(-b * x), a ~ 1, b ~ 1, nl = TRUE), data = df)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"先验选择\">先验选择</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[先验选择策略] --&gt; B[无信息先验]&#10;    A --&gt; C[弱信息先验]&#10;    A --&gt; D[信息先验]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;flat / uniform&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;normal(0, 10)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;student_t(3, 0, 2.5)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;来自文献/专家&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; I[先验预测检查]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;pp_check: 先验生成的数据是否合理&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[先验选择策略] --&gt; B[无信息先验]\n    A --&gt; C[弱信息先验]\n    A --&gt; D[信息先验]\n    B --&gt; E[\"flat / uniform\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"normal(0, 10)\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"student_t(3, 0, 2.5)\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"来自文献/专家\"]\n    A --&gt; I[先验预测检查]\n    I --&gt; J[\"pp_check: 先验生成的数据是否合理\"]</pre><p>推荐实践——弱信息先验（weakly informative priors）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# Stan 开发团队推荐的默认先验&#10;prior_summary(fit_bayes)&#10;&#10;# 先验预测检查&#10;fit_prior_only &lt;- brm(&#10;  y ~ x, data = df,&#10;  prior = c(prior(normal(0, 10), class = &quot;b&quot;)),&#10;  sample_prior = &quot;only&quot;&#10;)&#10;pp_check(fit_prior_only)  # 先验生成的数据分布是否合理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Stan 开发团队推荐的默认先验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>prior_summary(fit_bayes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 先验预测检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fit_prior_only &#x3C;- brm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y ~ x, data = df,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prior = c(prior(normal(0, 10), class = \"b\")),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sample_prior = \"only\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pp_check(fit_prior_only)  # 先验生成的数据分布是否合理</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"后验诊断\">后验诊断</h2><h3 id=\"收敛诊断\">收敛诊断</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# Rhat（应接近 1.00）和有效样本量&#10;summary(fit_bayes)&#10;&#10;# 轨迹图&#10;mcmc_trace(as.array(fit_bayes), pars = c(&quot;b_bill_length_mm&quot;, &quot;sigma&quot;))&#10;&#10;# 自相关图&#10;mcmc_acf(as.array(fit_bayes), pars = &quot;b_bill_length_mm&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Rhat（应接近 1.00）和有效样本量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(fit_bayes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 轨迹图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mcmc_trace(as.array(fit_bayes), pars = c(\"b_bill_length_mm\", \"sigma\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 自相关图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mcmc_acf(as.array(fit_bayes), pars = \"b_bill_length_mm\")</span></span></code></pre></div><p>收敛判据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>健康值</th>\n<th>问题信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>&lt; 1.01</td>\n<td>&gt; 1.05 表示未收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ESS bulk</td>\n<td>&gt; 400</td>\n<td>&lt; 100 需增加迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ESS tail</td>\n<td>&gt; 400</td>\n<td>尾部探索不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发散（divergences）</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>&gt; 0 需调整 <code>adapt_delta</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"后验预测检查\">后验预测检查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 后验预测 vs 观测数据&#10;pp_check(fit_bayes, type = &quot;dens_overlay&quot;, ndraws = 100)&#10;pp_check(fit_bayes, type = &quot;stat&quot;, stat = &quot;mean&quot;)&#10;pp_check(fit_bayes, type = &quot;intervals&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 后验预测 vs 观测数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pp_check(fit_bayes, type = \"dens_overlay\", ndraws = 100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pp_check(fit_bayes, type = \"stat\", stat = \"mean\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pp_check(fit_bayes, type = \"intervals\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模型比较\">模型比较</h2><p>贝叶斯模型比较使用 LOO-CV（Leave-One-Out Cross-Validation）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(loo)&#10;&#10;# 计算 LOO-IC&#10;loo_simple &lt;- loo(fit_simple)&#10;loo_complex &lt;- loo(fit_complex)&#10;&#10;# 比较&#10;loo_compare(loo_simple, loo_complex)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(loo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 计算 LOO-IC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loo_simple &#x3C;- loo(fit_simple)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loo_complex &#x3C;- loo(fit_complex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>loo_compare(loo_simple, loo_complex)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ELPD difference（Expected Log Pointwise Predictive Density）为负表示第一个模型更好。标准误提供不确定性度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战-层级贝叶斯元分析\">实战：层级贝叶斯元分析</h2><p>临床试验的元分析——从多个研究中估计整体效应量，同时考虑研究间异质性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 层级模型：每个研究的效应服从共同分布&#10;meta_fit &lt;- brm(&#10;  yi | se(sei) ~ 1 + (1 | study),&#10;  data = meta_data,&#10;  prior = c(&#10;    prior(normal(0, 1), class = &quot;Intercept&quot;),&#10;    prior(half_cauchy(0, 0.5), class = &quot;sd&quot;)&#10;  ),&#10;  iter = 4000,&#10;  cores = 4&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 后验总效应&#10;fixef(meta_fit)&#10;&#10;# 各研究的收缩效应&#10;ranef(meta_fit)&#10;&#10;# 森林图&#10;library(tidybayes)&#10;meta_fit |&gt;&#10;  spread_draws(r_study[study, ]) |&gt;&#10;  median_qi()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 层级模型：每个研究的效应服从共同分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>meta_fit &#x3C;- brm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  yi | se(sei) ~ 1 + (1 | study),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data = meta_data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prior = c(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(normal(0, 1), class = \"Intercept\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prior(half_cauchy(0, 0.5), class = \"sd\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  iter = 4000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cores = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 后验总效应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fixef(meta_fit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 各研究的收缩效应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ranef(meta_fit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 森林图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(tidybayes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>meta_fit |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  spread_draws(r_study[study, ]) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  median_qi()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>贝叶斯分析的结果天然包含不确定性——这让<a href=\"survival-analysis-r\">生存分析与临床统计</a>中的临床决策更加稳健。同时，brms 的公式接口直接继承了<a href=\"statistical-modeling-r\">R 统计建模</a>中的公式语法，从频率派迁移到贝叶斯只需最小的认知切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>贝叶斯方法的核心产出是完整后验分布，这让不确定性量化比频率派的点估计 + 置信区间更直接。</li>\n<li>小样本场景下先验起到正则化作用，多层结构中的 partial pooling 让参数互相借力。</li>\n<li>Stan 提供最大灵活性，cmdstanr 是当前推荐接口；brms 提供公式语法的便捷性，两者共享同一套采样引擎。</li>\n<li>brms 的公式扩展覆盖了零膨胀、序数、分布参数化与非线性模型，远超标准 R 公式的表达能力。</li>\n<li>弱信息先验是推荐默认，配合 <code>sample_prior = &quot;only&quot;</code> 的先验预测检查可以验证先验是否合理。</li>\n<li>收敛必须用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、ESS 和发散次数共同判断，任一不达标都不应解读后验结果。</li>\n<li>模型比较走 LOO-CV 的 ELPD，标准误给出差异的可靠区间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贝叶斯分析与 Stan/brms","id":"贝叶斯分析与-stan-brms"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯框架基础","id":"贝叶斯框架基础"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么选择贝叶斯","id":"为什么选择贝叶斯"},{"level":2,"text":"Stan 概率编程","id":"stan-概率编程"},{"level":3,"text":"cmdstanr 接口","id":"cmdstanr-接口"},{"level":2,"text":"brms：公式语法的贝叶斯建模","id":"brms-公式语法的贝叶斯建模"},{"level":3,"text":"brms 公式扩展","id":"brms-公式扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"先验选择","id":"先验选择"},{"level":2,"text":"后验诊断","id":"后验诊断"},{"level":3,"text":"收敛诊断","id":"收敛诊断"},{"level":3,"text":"后验预测检查","id":"后验预测检查"},{"level":2,"text":"模型比较","id":"模型比较"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：层级贝叶斯元分析","id":"实战-层级贝叶斯元分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"R 统计建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/statistical-modeling-r"},"next":{"title":"生存分析与临床统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/statistical-computing/survival-analysis-r"}}